<title>TURKEY: Turk Brisa dividend 3,220 lira per share.</title>
<headline>Turk Brisa dividend 3,220 lira per share.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish tyre producer Brisa Bridgestone Sabanci Lastik Sanayi ve Ticaret A.S. said it would begin to distribute on March 31 a 3,220 lira dividend per 1,000 lira nominal valued share from its 1996 profits.</p>
</text>
